e原石\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*20\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"5565\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/12/08/160182379/605f7e564ce17decc9e09508567776ce_5737054899684571258.jpg\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"摩拉\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"20000\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5565/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5565/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/12/08/160182379/605f7e564ce17decc9e09508567776ce_5737054899684571258.jpg\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e摩拉\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*20000\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e说起来，打铁也是一种非常有效的健身方式呢。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e之前打造健身器材的时候，我经常往希诺宁的工坊跑。我一直想试试亲手抡锤，可惜总被希诺宁拦着。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e话说回来，这里的设备可以借我用吗？等我有了新的点子，正好可以尝试下。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"505235\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/04/08/50494840/2c9abc6f84899f24679d7b4a94076db0_2410651619880966835.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"「沃陆之邦」的勇进\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/505235/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/505235/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/04/08/50494840/2c9abc6f84899f24679d7b4a94076db0_2410651619880966835.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e「沃陆之邦」的勇进\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"870\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/07/01/80410800/2b54a434925724d39f56f4b3f57ab6fc_1180444687193989795.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"最胜紫晶断片\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/870/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/870/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/07/01/80410800/2b54a434925724d39f56f4b3f57ab6fc_1180444687193989795.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e最胜紫晶断片\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"5566\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/12/08/160182379/f9de059da2ee541c770eb1c83d0018a9_6412355601661015430.jpg\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"原石\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"20\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5566/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5566/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/12/08/160182379/f9de059da2ee541c770eb1c83d0018a9_6412355601661015430.jpg\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e原石\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*20\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"5565\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/12/08/160182379/605f7e564ce17decc9e09508567776ce_5737054899684571258.jpg\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"摩拉\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"20000\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5565/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5565/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/12/08/160182379/605f7e564ce17decc9e09508567776ce_5737054899684571258.jpg\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e摩拉\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*20000\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e辛苦你安置这些家具了，看到它们就像回家了一样。不过，越过屋檐看不到圣山，暂时还是有些不习惯…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e有时间来沃陆之邦走走吧，我来招待你。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e有个安乐窝是不错，但因此停下脚步的话，人生就没有意义了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"]]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8226","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel"